1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,500
A bad lemma should fail in minutes,
not consume weeks.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,600
Can a smooth three-dimensional fluid
become infinitely rough?

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,500
Vortices stretch.
Viscosity smooths.

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,400
Protas: extreme-flow search.
Tao: quantitative bounds.

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,200
Here, we attack intermediate lemmas.

6
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,900
The tests became deeper—
and slower.

7
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:21,400
Scaling. Triads.
Exact gradients. K12.

8
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,200
Counterexample? Stop. Save.
Narrow. Restart.

9
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,700
16 paths failed.
1 partial estimate proved. L4 remains open.

10
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:29,700
Next decision: 1–3 days.
Full solution: no honest estimate.
